  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is active in India and Bangladesh and works with two issues, 1) to develop a professional children&#xb4;s theatre in certain areas of the two countries and 2) to carry out drama training for and with children and youth in the same areas with the purpose to strengthen not only their creativity but also their self-confidence.</narrative>
